WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.775
Step two reads the
cutover and the rollback.

2
00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:06.913
The user and the sequel login are
disabled, and the rollback enables them.

3
00:00:06.913 --> 00:00:10.902
Contoso payroll users and Contoso
sequel admins are Windows groups,

4
00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:14.612
so their lines are deny connect
sequel and grant connect sequel.

5
00:00:14.612 --> 00:00:19.438
Alter login disable can't deny a Windows
group, and a server-permission deny can.

6
00:00:19.438 --> 00:00:22.522
Contoso sequel admins is
also a sys-admin member,

7
00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:25.451
and a deny doesn't apply
to members of sys-admin.

8
00:00:25.451 --> 00:00:29.788
So the cutover takes the group out of the
role first, and the rollback puts it back.

9
00:00:29.788 --> 00:00:31.130
Nothing is dropped.
